uestion q6\">\n    <div class=\"qline\">\n      <span class=\"num\">6</span>虽然毕业了但是公司没有交<span class=\"highlight orange\">社保</span>算吗？\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer\">处于两年择业期的话，是算的。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"question q7\">\n    <div class=\"qline\">\n      <span class=\"num\">7</span>在找工作签了<span class=\"highlight orange\">三方协议</span>和<span class=\"highlight orange\">劳动合同</span>还算应届生吗？\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer\">\n      不算。三方协议不算正式的劳动合同，但签定了正式的<br>\n      <span class=\"underline\">劳动合同就不算应届毕业生了。</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder star-one\">[Annotation: star at upper right]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder circle-two\">[Annotation: circled 2]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder circle-one\">[Annotation: circled 1]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder star-two\">[Annotation: star at lower center]</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
